
# flux frame (0.9.0)
tile.fluxecho.frame.base.name=Flux Frame Base
fluxecho.frame.base.tip=§3The floor of the Flux Nexus§r\nMost of its octagonal base
tile.fluxecho.frame.base_lit.name=Lit Frame Base
fluxecho.frame.base_lit.tip=§3A base with a conduit line in it§r\nThe eight spokes of the Flux Nexus's base that carry the flux to the middle
tile.fluxecho.frame.pillar.name=Frame Pillar
fluxecho.frame.pillar.tip=§3The frame's bones§r\nIn a Flux Nexus they turn into curved ribs you can walk through once it forms; an Echo Library's corners and eaves are made of them too
tile.fluxecho.frame.conduit.name=Flux Conduit
fluxecho.frame.conduit.tip=§3A pillar with the flux running inside§r\nThe column in the middle of the Flux Nexus; once formed it turns into a column of light
tile.fluxecho.frame.ring.name=Ring Segment
fluxecho.frame.ring.tip=§3A piece of a ring§r\nThe sixteen on top of the Flux Nexus float up and turn once it forms
tile.fluxecho.frame.seat.name=Crystal Seat
fluxecho.frame.seat.tip=§3Where the core sits§r\nThe heart of the Flux Nexus; once formed the core floats in the air
tile.fluxecho.frame.foundation.name=Module Foundation
fluxecho.frame.foundation.tip=§3The ground a module stands on§r\nThe Echo Library and the other modules are built on it
tile.fluxecho.frame.shelf.name=Echo Shelf
fluxecho.frame.shelf.tip=§3A shelf for one book§r\nThe walls of the Echo Library. Once it forms, walk in: right-click with a sample to shelve it, with an empty hand to take it down, with a blank index card to write one
tile.fluxecho.frame.console.name=Console Stand
fluxecho.frame.console.tip=§3A waist-high stand§r\nUnder the Flux Nexus's core it puts the core at eye height; the reading desk in the middle of a library's hall is one too\nOnce formed, right-click it to open its machine's GUI
tile.fluxecho.frame.anchor.name=Cladding Anchor
fluxecho.frame.anchor.tip=§3A frame block with a hexagonal socket plate on each face§r\nThe city's buildings carry a few of them; the claddings of later versions will grow from them
tile.fluxecho.frame.float.name=Floating Foundation
fluxecho.frame.float.tip=§3An anti-gravity lattice cube: a grid to walk on, a lifting glow under it§r\nThe decks of the sky ring's platforms, floating over the city
